      "side": 1,
      "message": "I entitled EC tablet mode in purpose.\nThis is a legacy issue since reef family, references are b:35586669 and b:35944176.\nWhen the GMR is affected by external magnetic field, it could unexpectedly deassert TABLET_MODE_L or LID_OPEN.\nThis patch along w/ down below dependent two are trying to mitigate the unexpected TABLET_MODE_L deassertion.\n\nAs to this one for the convertible device, when it hovers on top of the other coral devices, by watching TABLET_MODE_L and lid_angle, there is chance that the upper convertible enters chrome tablet mode unexpectedly w/ keyboard been disabled while the form is in the clamshell in reality.\n\nIn short, an external magnetic field can make GMR deassert TABLET_MODE_L while the lid is not folding into 360 degrees, I shall make commit messages more clear, my apology.",
